      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BIANCA'S EYELASH (1) is worth forgiving last start after finishing fifth (19.44) from Box 6 at Wagga over 320m. Goes very well from this draw with three wins and three minor placings from seven starts. Better than last start and worth following up. ROAR OF THUNDER (7) goes very well at the course with three wins and a placing from seven starts. Below best last time at this track (19.15) in a Grade 4, finishing a 7 length fourth. Can feature in the finish. LET'S GO OUT (4) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (19.38) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Safe beginner but tricky box to overcome. Can feature with the right run. SASHA KEEPING (6) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
